1
00:00:00,158 --> 00:00:02,258
(Sheldon:)There's no excuse for that.

2
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:04,460
(Sheldon:)And I'm truly sorry.

3
00:00:04,462 --> 00:00:06,462
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

4
00:00:06,464 --> 00:00:07,794
(Leonard:)I appreciate that.

5
00:00:07,799 --> 00:00:09,869
(Sheldon:)I want you to know
that that is sincere.

6
00:00:09,868 --> 00:00:11,138
I-I do feel bad.

7
00:00:11,136 --> 00:00:13,336
(Sheldon:)I'm not just saying it
to be included on your trip.

8
00:00:13,338 --> 00:00:15,538
(Leonard:)Appreciate that, too.

9
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:16,940
(Sheldon:)Terrific.

10
00:00:16,942 --> 00:00:18,942
(Sheldon:)Now all that's left
is for you to invite me to come.

11
00:00:18,944 --> 00:00:20,214
Me to ask, “Are you sure?”

12
00:00:20,211 --> 00:00:21,381
You to say, “Absolutely.”

13
00:00:21,379 --> 00:00:22,479
(Sheldon:)And then me
to bring it home with,

14
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:25,210
“How could I say no
to that face?”

15
00:00:25,216 --> 00:00:27,846
(Leonard:)You're still not coming.

16
00:00:27,852 --> 00:00:30,222
What? But I apologized
and I meant it.

17
00:00:30,221 --> 00:00:31,991
(Sheldon:)I know that we don't play
this game very often,

18
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:34,060
(Sheldon:)but you're doing it wrong.

19
00:00:34,059 --> 00:00:36,829
(Leonard:)Sheldon, I accept
your apology, but you upset

20
00:00:36,828 --> 00:00:38,128
(Leonard:)a lot of people
while you were sick.

21
00:00:38,129 --> 00:00:40,259
(Leonard:)I'm not in a position
to just say you can come.

22
00:00:40,265 --> 00:00:42,465
(Sheldon:)Well, all right.

23
00:00:42,467 --> 00:00:45,667
(Sheldon:)What if I apologize
to all of them?

24
00:00:45,670 --> 00:00:47,600
(Leonard:)Fine, if you
apologize to everyone,

25
00:00:47,606 --> 00:00:49,806
(Leonard:)they all say it's okay,
then yes, you can come.

26
00:00:49,808 --> 00:00:51,278
Challenge accepted!

27
00:00:51,276 --> 00:00:54,406
(Sheldon:)Sounds like it's time for
the Sheldon Cooper Apology Tour.

28
00:00:56,715 --> 00:00:58,015
(Leonard:)Well, I hope
it's as much fun

29
00:00:58,016 --> 00:01:01,586
(Leonard:)as the Sheldon Cooper
Spell-Checks Local Menus Tour.

